{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936450/extras/4ddd9893b44b769a1169c1b6e7e12fcd.poster.avif?t=1771700188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936450/extras/4ddd9893b44b769a1169c1b6e7e12fcd.webm?t=1771700188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936450/extras/4ddd9893b44b769a1169c1b6e7e12fcd.mp4?t=1771700188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cult of Shadows is a dynamic action game combining elements of Hack and Slash and roguelite genres based on player skills. Fight hordes of enemies and gain experience. Strengthen your character and skills. Defeat cultists and the Mithos they summon. Collect and upgrade items, obtain unique items, and use them to fight in dark arenas and procedurally generated dungeons. Learn the behaviors of your opponents. Unlock new heroes and try out new builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936450/extras/4771d95df0f5d2f5fdedff603350c5ce.poster.avif?t=1771700188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936450/extras/4771d95df0f5d2f5fdedff603350c5ce.webm?t=1771700188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936450/extras/4771d95df0f5d2f5fdedff603350c5ce.mp4?t=1771700188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What can you expect in Cult of Shadows?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting large numbers of enemies simultaneously,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mighty beasts to defeat,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improving your character's attributes and skills,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of dying and coming back,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting items\u2014common, magical, blessed or cursed, and unique,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrading your items,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting in arenas and procedurally generated dungeons,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a challenging game that focuses on the player's skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936450/extras/7817efa668516be7e330bf644a355b93.avif?t=1771700188\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936450/extras_big/7817efa668516be7e330bf644a355b93.webp?t=1771700188 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What will you find in the game?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 unique levels,</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 procedurally generated dungeons,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 playable characters with unique skills,</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3936450?t=1771700188","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3936450?t=1771700188","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936450/8c5027605ba447dfba5c0cc4b850ab14dac690ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771700188","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936450/8c5027605ba447dfba5c0cc4b850ab14dac690ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771700188